			"url": "https://github.com/home-assistant/architecture/discussions/929",
			"summary": "A maintainer proposes a new `event` entity component whose state is the timestamp of the last firing, with a declared list of event types, as a friendlier alternative to raw bus events, fake binary sensors and device automation triggers. The proposal lists alternatives considered and is later edited to note that an `event_input` bundling idea was dropped.",
